Subject: [PATCH 256/307] !F (Terrain Plate) Add height stamping to the level
 heightmap.

Add an editor command that copies the live baked relief into CHeightmap with
undo support and correct world-to-heightmap axis mapping. Reject values outside
the level height range before modifying any cells.
